    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπυρσεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>communicate by beacon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Mith.</u>
					79
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>blazon abroad as by beacon-fires,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πράξεις τῇ δόξῃ εἰς ἅπαντας
					τοὺς ἀνθρώπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			: c.gen., <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				2.22
			</span></i> (v.l.<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπῠρ-πυρσαίνω</span></b> ): —
				Med.
			, <i>make signals by beacons,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.19.7
			</span></i>.</div>
